cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LoyaltyLens, please cite it as below."
title: "LoyaltyLens: Do Prompt-Installed Secret Loyalties Transfer to Weight-Installed Ones?"
abstract: >-
  Model organisms of secret loyalty toward fictional principals, installed by
  system prompt and by LoRA fine-tuning, used to test whether linear probes
  trained on prompt-installed loyalty detect weight-installed loyalty across
  installation method and principal.
authors:
